Subject: [PATCH] erofs: integrate ACL dm-verity referrers

Source: https://github.com/dallasd1/containerd
Base: f2ffd5c12bd8e2bea360e268da054f27eb3612ea
Tip: d7b80e48cf40b94957a05e4a130a19d5ff3aa9d4

Net diff from Base to Tip. Apply after the shared Azure Linux patches
to the signed EROFS source tree only. This includes mapper lifecycle,
signed identity and rotation, referrer discovery error preservation,
and the plain EROFS retry after signature rejection in IPE audit mode.

